  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Confidence Building and Mediation in the Adjacency Zone of Belize and Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to enhance peace and stability in the Adjacency Zone of Belize and Guatemala.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of the actions is strengthened coordination and relations between relevant governmental and non-governmental actors and communities. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The continuation of the Organization of American States (OAS) mission is vital for Belize and Guatemala. It aims to alleviate tensions, prevent conflicts from escalating through diplomatic mediation and on-field technical assistance by the OAS. It oversees the implementation of peace agreements, and enhances the capacity for confidence-building measures agreed upon by Belize and Guatemala in 2005&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
